sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App<br>[implements GattClientResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GattClient]
    participant Peripheral as BLE Peripheral

    Note over Node, Peripheral: Messages between Node and BLE Peripheral<br>are link-layer events, not driven by the App.<br>The App only observes them through<br>Echo callbacks (e.g. MtuSizeExchangeComplete).

    App->>Node: GattClient.MtuSizeExchangeRequest()

    alt Successful exchange
        Node-)Peripheral: ATT_EXCHANGE_MTU_REQ (client rx MTU)
        Peripheral-)Node: ATT_EXCHANGE_MTU_RSP (server rx MTU)
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.MtuSizeExchangeComplete(247)
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.OperationComplete(success)
    else Peripheral / L2CAP failure
        Node-)Peripheral: ATT_EXCHANGE_MTU_REQ (client rx MTU)
        Peripheral-)Node: ATT_ERROR_RSP (error code)
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.OperationComplete(error)
    end
